source: crates/mokly-cli/src/_tests_/grammar_tests.rs
expression: "Cli::command().render_long_help().to_string()"
---
Build and browse static mockup catalogues

Usage: mokly [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  serve    Serve the catalogue and comparisons; watch by default
  build    Validate and render every view into a static site
  publish  Build into a private directory and upload

Options:
      --config <CONFIG>
          Configuration JSON path; otherwise search upward

      --base <BASE>
          Comparison base ref; overrides review.base (default origin/main)

      --sidecars <SIDECARS>
          Sidecar count; defaults to MOKLY_SIDECARS or the core count

      --debug-timings
          Write timing JSON to stderr and select plain output

      --port <PORT>
          Starting port, 0 through 65535 (default 4173)

      --watch
          Watch source files (the default)

      --no-watch
          Serve one snapshot without watching files

      --open
          Open the catalogue after its URL is ready

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version

Configuration: search upward for mokly.config.json, or pass --config PATH.
